.googleapis.com/css2?family=Manrope:wght@300;400;500;600;700;800&display=swap\">\n<style>\n  /* The reference hero (/in-home-aba-therapy) renders antialiased. Eleven pages,\n     including /bcba-team and every /bcbas/ profile, were on the browser default of\n     auto, which paints strokes thicker and compounded the 600 -> 700 substitution. */\n  body { -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased; -moz-osx-font-smoothing: grayscale; }\n</style>\n<style>\n  /* Eyebrow colour, one value sitewide: #3ba5a8, the reference teal on\n     /in-home-aba-therapy and 18 of the 33 eyebrows already on the site.\n     Five classes were corrected at source via the style API: .mm-eyebrow,\n     .g90-eyebrow, .author-profile_eyebrow, .author-box_eyebrow and\n     .mm-eyebrow-line. The sixth, .mm-topics-eyebrow, is declared inside the\n     /blog topics embed rather than as a Webflow class, so it is overridden here.\n     body-prefixed for (0,1,1): the embed's own rule is (0,1,0) in a body style\n     block, which wins on document order against an equal-specificity head rule. */\n  body .mm-topics-eyebrow { color: #3ba5a8; }\n</style>"